-- =====================================================================
-- Demo: special lecture "Computer Vision Applications & AI in Industry",
-- from its real poster and announcement, with the department newsletter
-- (จดหมายข่าว ฉบับที่ 75, ต.ค. 2569) as its SAR recap poster.
--
-- Mon 12 Oct 2569 (2026), 09.00–12.00, ห้อง 1639 ชั้น 6 อาคารวิทยาศาสตร์ 1;
-- speaker คุณเขมรินทร์ วีระเผ่า, CTO of Connectedtech (named in the
-- description: events have no speaker field). Open to students and
-- outsiders, limited seats; registration closed Sun 11 Oct. Finished and
-- closed, with certificates. The announcement registered people through a
-- Google Form; here they register in the system, so that link is left out.
--
-- Who came: about two thirds of the demo students (none suspended); one
-- registered but didn't come. Their evaluations and certificates are made by
-- seed_certificates.sql, which must run after this file.
--
-- Apply AFTER schema, seed, demo_organizer, seed_blacklist. Safe to run
-- again: it removes event 1054 (registrations, check-ins, evaluations,
-- certificates and SAR cascade) first — then run seed_certificates.sql again.
--   docker exec -i cpsu-etms-mysql mysql --default-character-set=utf8mb4 -uroot cpsu_etms < database/seed_cv_ai_industry.sql
-- =====================================================================

USE cpsu_etms;
SET NAMES utf8mb4;

DELETE FROM events WHERE id = 1054;

